## Compatibility result

Pinned Java `PopProcessQueue.fillPopProcessQueueInfo(null)` throws
`java.lang.NullPointerException`. Rust adds
`fill_pop_process_queue_info_nullable` and `PopProcessQueueError::NullInfo`.
The direct invoked Java fixture and Rust facade comparison check the exception
class. The facade fixture now records an exact crosswalk for all 11 declared
public PopProcessQueue methods, including Java `toString()` through Rust's
`Display` implementation. Fixture SHA-256:
`a32d9a980e5079fa5fccaa6f6d46287946883099550e0bc4f04854892b0ca065`.

